o waypoint to corroborate. The trip record shows pickup_amended_at and dropoff_amended_at both null and amended_optimal_distance_km null, so POL-RD-05 cannot run. The vehicle type is RYDE_X, not RYDE_POOL, so POL-RD-12 is not in play. The deviation is not MATERIAL (25.9% < 50% and 5.44 km < 8.0 km), so POL-RD-06 is not engaged and no driver-conduct referral arises; in any event driver_profile.deviation_flags_90d is 0 against completed_trips_90d of 191, so no repeat-deviation pattern could be established on the only citable fields. Nothing is added or subtracted under POL-RD-09: the fare carries zero ERP lines, zero tolls and no airport surcharge, so there is no pass-through correction and no billing-integrity line, and POL-RD-09(1) bars adding any off-route charge on top of the POL-RD-02 figure. The distance charged (26.4 km) matches the trace (26.44 km) to within 0.04 km, so no unbilled-distance shortfall and no driver compensation arise.\n\nConfidence is capped at 1.0 by the artifacts carrying the deciding facts — EV-GPS-02801, EV-TRIP-02801 and EV-FARE-02801, all weight_multiplier 1.0; the MISSING advisory carries weight 0.0 and carries no fact. The monetary effect (6.95) is below the POL-GEN-05 execution threshold of 8.00, so it executes automatically. No clause produces a referral on these facts."
