red by POL-RD-09(1). No exculpatory clause reduces the excess — the chat log (EV-CHAT-02801) holds 0 messages (no POL-RD-04 rider instruction), the trip record shows no pickup/dropoff amendment (POL-RD-05 cannot run), the vehicle type is RYDE_X not RYDE_POOL (POL-RD-12 irrelevant), and the billed 26.4 km matches the traced 26.44 km (no unbilled-distance shortfall, so no POL-RD-04 driver compensation).\n\nThe monetary effect of SGD 6.95 is below the SGD 8.00 execution threshold (POL-GEN-05), so it executes automatically. This ruling is provisional and either party may appeal under POL-GEN-04. No clause produces a referral on these facts. Confidence is 0.95, within the cap of 1.0 set by the deciding artifacts (all weight 1.0)."
